description = "A player-founded village: a Hearth, members with roles and a shared Stockpile. It grows from founded to growing to town as members and days accumulate (growing also by completed projects), members build projects together, and it is abandoned when no member is active. Phase 203 replaced its claim with owned structures and clans: a settlement claims no land, and Phase 204 migrates each one to a Clan with the same name, members and roles (Clan.migration). Rule changes are made through GovernanceSystem proposals."
